      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now severe pre-eclampsia is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get a urine protein test, for pre-eclampsia. I'm gonna put you on labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now, single dose. You take it by mouth. That should help with severe hypertension. You need to go to the maternity unit straight away. See me again straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
